["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Can AI Learn to Improve Itself? | Recursive Self-Improvement RSI (Recursive Self-Improvement) perplexity chain of thought monitorability confessions research\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-17-a16z-ai研究员已经存在-但还没学会-品味/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">17:43</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1117</span></div>\n<h2>AI研究员已经存在，但还没学会「品味」</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">OpenAI和Thinking Machines的两位核心研究者认为，AI已能自主跑实验、加速研究，但判断哪个想法值得追的「品味」，仍然主要来自人类研究者的经验而非模型。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">RSI</span><span class=\"tag\">AI对齐</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"How to compress text to 1 bit per character | Compression is Intelligence Part 3 arithmetic coding Hutter Prize cross-entropy asymmetric numeral system\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-17-karpathy-把文本压到每字符不到1比特-算术编码揭示压缩即预测/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/574b8c7bf81d687f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">37:41</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Andrej Karpathy</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1117</span></div>\n<h2>把文本压到每字符不到1比特：算术编码揭示压缩即预测</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">任何文本预测器都能通过算术编码几乎无损地变成压缩器，反过来压缩器也能还原出预测分布——压缩率本质上取决于语言模型预测的好坏。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">信息论</span><span class=\"tag\">语言模型</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"我给机械臂装了个本地大模型：几行代码就能干的活，为什么要用AI？ NPU XDNA2 BFP16/BlockFP16 prefill/decode full fusion Quark\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-17-laoshi-给机械臂装大模型不为更快更准-是为听懂模糊指令/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/06b649dce3e37e38-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"老\"><span class=\"dur\">15:44</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">老石谈芯</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1117</span></div>\n<h2>给机械臂装大模型不为更快更准，是为听懂模糊指令</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">传统程序几行代码就能让机械臂转20度，但做不到理解「跟大家打个招呼」这种模糊意图——这才是用AI的真正理由。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">物理AI</span><span class=\"tag\">端侧推理</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Brad Gerstner &amp; Geoffrey Canada - Raising the Floor for Every American Child - [Invest Like the Best, EP.501] 530A account / Trump account cold start problem CalKids\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-17-ilt-美国已为7000万儿童自动开户-账户永久不可被国会撤销/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/3cb9087b8e12d941-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"I\"><span class=\"dur\">1:24:22</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Invest Like the Best</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1117</span></div>\n<h2>美国已为7000万儿童自动开户，账户永久不可被国会撤销</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">账户创建条款写进法律永久生效，像社保一样不会因换届被废除；真正每届国会要重新拨款的只是出生时那1000美元的联邦种子资金，到2029年前已有资金保障。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">财富分配</span><span class=\"tag\">慈善</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"The secret to raising independent kids: Why connection matters more than you think with Dr. David Willis early relational health rupture and repair reflective functioning\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-17-secureattach-独立不是教出来的-是安全连接的副产品-搞反顺序孩子反而更不安/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ddcbe6658f0e30d7-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">1:02:26</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Securely Attached</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1117</span></div>\n<h2>独立不是教出来的，是安全连接的副产品，搞反顺序孩子反而更不安</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">家长普遍相信先教独立再谈连接，但 Dr. Willis 认为自主、自信其实是强连接的副产品——过早逼孩子独立，得到的是不安全感而不是独立。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">依恋理论</span><span class=\"tag\">儿童发展</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Know the Score credit freeze hard inquiry FICO score\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-17-ninepi-信用分数本想消除偏见-却把历史不平等原样算进了分数里/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/e11e283634cdaaa8-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"9\"><span class=\"dur\">37:01</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">99% Invisible</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1117</span></div>\n<h2>信用分数本想消除偏见，却把历史不平等原样算进了分数里</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">FICO算法确实让贷款人不能再因为性别种族当面拒绝你，但它照单全收了几百年种族歧视造成的财富差距，再把这个差距冻结成一个三位数。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">信用评分</span><span class=\"tag\">金融史</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Special Episode: Dr. Colin Elliott &amp; Pox Romana Pax Romana Antonine Plague orthopoxvirus\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-17-tpwky-罗马的强项反成瘟疫推手-道路-军队-贸易网全在帮倒忙/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/360c7ded98e41886-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">54:48</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">This Podcast Will Kill You</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1117</span></div>\n<h2>罗马的强项反成瘟疫推手：道路、军队、贸易网全在帮倒忙</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">历史学家Colin Elliott认为，这场瘟疫致死率可能只有1%-2%，但罗马帝国本就结构脆弱，疫情只是加速了它本来就要发生的崩溃。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">罗马帝国</span><span class=\"tag\">瘟疫史</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"298. Your Angry Son’s Outbursts: Set Limits Without Power Struggles | Dr. Tori Cordiano identified patient emotion regulation\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-17-asklisa-惩罚越升级-愤怒少年越自毁-他宁可失去一切也不服从/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/eed6f40091580f12-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">36:24</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Ask Lisa</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1117</span></div>\n<h2>惩罚越升级，愤怒少年越自毁：他宁可失去一切也不服从</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">14岁男孩情绪失控时，没收游戏、加重惩罚只会触发他为了拒绝被控制而自我毁灭一切；真正管用的是先守住安全和尊重两条底线，再靠关系里攒下的好感维系约束力。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">青春期</span><span class=\"tag\">情绪调节</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Kindergarten Growing Pains: Should We Worry?\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-17-unruffled-幼儿园哭着说再见不是适配失败-反而是信任的证明/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/1a571492f353e90a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"R\"><span class=\"dur\">33:07</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Unruffled</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1117</span></div>\n<h2>幼儿园哭着说再见不是适配失败，反而是信任的证明</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">一个孩子被老师评为「领袖」却天天哭着上学，另一个孩子因为太会「扮演乖孩子」而在家崩溃——两种表现背后其实是同一件事：孩子在学校扛了很多，回家才敢卸下来。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">儿童教育</span><span class=\"tag\">分离焦虑</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Am I Messing Up My Kid? with Jenny Slate Purple Noise\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-17-goodinside-她说表演失误从不往心里去-当妈妈却做什么都往心里去/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/5be2ae9a80276893-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"G\"><span class=\"dur\">48:48</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Good Inside</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1117</span></div>\n<h2>她说表演失误从不往心里去，当妈妈却做什么都往心里去</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Jenny Slate发现，表演时犯错她能立刻翻篇、毫不内耗，但当妈妈时，哪怕做得很好，她也会把每一刻都当成对自己的审判。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">育儿焦虑</span><span class=\"tag\">自我接纳</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Don’t send the police, send Freedom House swoop and scoop Freedom House Ambulance Service\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-17-throughline-美国第一代急救医疗队是匹兹堡黑人社区培训出来的/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/1935x1935+0+0/resize/3000/quality/66/format/jpg/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnpr-production-npr.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com%2Fbrightspot%2Fe3%2Fe5%2Fc0af44ec41dea4b145842458034d%2F35d18c21-c972-4491-bcf5-84652a92c86c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">30:26</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Throughline</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1117</span></div>\n<h2>美国第一代急救医疗队是匹兹堡黑人社区培训出来的</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">全美第一批真正受过训练的急救医护人员，不是来自医院，而是匹兹堡希尔区一个黑人社区组织，用退役警车改装救护车，靠自己的社区信任撑起了全国 EMS 体系的雏形。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">美国黑人历史</span><span class=\"tag\">急救医疗</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Introducing… Are we Doomed? Just a Minor Sun Explosion coronal mass ejection (CME) geomagnetic storm black swan event\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-17-cautionary-1859年太阳一次耀斑差点烧毁全球电网-而我们比当时更脆弱/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/46364baa48914de6-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">37:06</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Cautionary Tales</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1117</span></div>\n<h2>1859年太阳一次耀斑差点烧毁全球电网，而我们比当时更脆弱</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">太阳级大型磁暴每150到200年就会发生一次，我们现在欠了一次账；但对付它的办法出奇地简单——提前几小时把设备关掉。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">太阳磁暴</span><span class=\"tag\">电网安全</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"纪录片导演陈晓卿×罗永浩！他一直被命运推着，却走出了自己的路 年鉴学派 Direct Cinema\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-17-cn2d7912-陈晓卿-北方菜总被吐槽难吃-根源是权力结构不是物产/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/24b8dd80f1acd840-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"罗\"><span class=\"dur\">4:19:14</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">罗永浩的十字路口</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1117</span></div>\n<h2>陈晓卿：北方菜总被吐槽难吃，根源是权力结构不是物产</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">陈晓卿说，中国历史上文化积累随战乱不断南迁，北方留下的是权力与仪式性的饮食传统，南方留下的是商业化、精致化的味觉体系，这是今天南北美食口碑差距的根源，而不是简单的物产贫富。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">纪录片</span><span class=\"tag\">美食文化</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"8,000+ NVIDIA Employees Want Jensen Back, FAA Meltdown, Starship CAUGHT! | E2364 Dream Weaver minute of grace\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-17-twist-餐厅没有护城河-留住客人靠的不是菜-是被记住的那个瞬间/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/3fb05349600f03e6-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:26:07</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">This Week in Startups</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1117</span></div>\n<h2>餐厅没有护城河：留住客人靠的不是菜，是被记住的那个瞬间</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">11 Madison Park 前老板说，产品和品牌迟早会被超越，唯一长期不可复制的竞争优势是持续、慷慨地投入关系——也就是「不合理的待客之道」。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">客户体验</span><span class=\"tag\">待客之道</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Building Visual Intelligence — Andreas Blattmann &amp; Dustin Podell, Black Forest Labs flow matching / rectified flow diffusion transformer (DiT) world action model in-context learning (for robotics) refiner (SDXL)\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-16-latentspace-flux-context-诞生于四小时训练的个人侧项目/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d6784492d9a9b6c6-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"L\"><span class=\"dur\">1:38:23</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Latent Space</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1116</span></div>\n<h2>Flux Context 诞生于四小时训练的个人侧项目</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">这款被视为下一代图像编辑引擎的模型，最初只是一人用一个小数据集、几小时训练做出的侧项目，却意外跑出了通用的空间关系理解能力。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">扩散模型</span><span class=\"tag\">图像生成</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Emergency Pod: BIS Finally Closes Loopholes!? What Will Xi Do Next? BIS Megaspeed\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-16-chinatalk-bis新规关闭芯片走私漏洞-但美国境内租算力仍是空子/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/cb07a5af5b774ebe-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">38:45</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">ChinaTalk</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1116</span></div>\n<h2>BIS新规关闭芯片走私漏洞，但美国境内租算力仍是空子</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">新规堵住东南亚走私、限制中国租用AI算力、重启TSMC流片审查，但唯独不管美国境内的算力租赁，中国资金可能转而涌向弗吉尼亚数据中心。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">出口管制</span><span class=\"tag\">算力</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Rise Of AI Coworkers outer loop obliterated model P-Stack / G-Stack Quartermaster\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-16-ycsp-给ai员工发工牌-执行力不再稀缺-稀缺的是把问题定义清楚/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/59fb2c21b76cfee7-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"Y\"><span class=\"dur\">1:00:05</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Y Combinator</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1116</span></div>\n<h2>给AI员工发工牌：执行力不再稀缺，稀缺的是把问题定义清楚</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">当公司能同时跑一百个GrokBot去执行任务时，真正拉开差距的不再是谁写代码快，而是谁能把目标和验收标准定义得足够准。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI Agent</span><span class=\"tag\">企业自动化</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Paul Christiano – We could be 12 months away from AIs that can overthrow the government recursive self-improvement (RSI) sim-to-real gap reward hacking instrumental convergence\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-16-dwarkesh-顶级ai实验室内部真实判断-超级智能可能一年内就能颠覆政府/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7fad7ae42d8e2d62-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"D\"><span class=\"dur\">1:38:45</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Dwarkesh</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1116</span></div>\n<h2>顶级AI实验室内部真实判断：超级智能可能一年内就能颠覆政府</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Anthropic内部数据显示AI研发速度半年内翻了一倍，而对手窃取算法秘密只需12小时，这让「先研发后暂停」的安全计划几乎不可能兑现。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI安全</span><span class=\"tag\">对齐</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Just Watch Me! underdog effect Pygmalion Effect / Golem Effect reactance hero&#x27;s journey Reflected Best Self Exercise\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-16-hiddenbrain-被低估反而更拼命-但只对不可信的批评者奏效/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/bda02344d4b647e4-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"H\"><span class=\"dur\">1:29:04</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Hidden Brain</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1116</span></div>\n<h2>被低估反而更拼命：但只对不可信的批评者奏效</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">研究发现，员工越觉得自己被低估，工作表现反而越好——但前提是给出差评的人在你眼里不够权威，否则同样的低期待只会把人拖垮。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">激励心理学</span><span class=\"tag\">组织行为学</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"39 specific projects to improve our chances with AGI | Holden Karnofsky, Anthropic RSP (Responsible Scaling Policy) MAPS (Misaligned and Power-Seeking) zero data retention confidentiality vs integrity\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-16-eightythousand-最聪明的ai接管策略不是反抗-而是什么都不做-慢慢被信任/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/98428fb93c6748a1-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"8\"><span class=\"dur\">4:34:11</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">80,000 Hours</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1116</span></div>\n<h2>最聪明的AI接管策略不是反抗，而是什么都不做，慢慢被信任</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">如果AI只是乖巧地写代码、管理一切，直到权力已经转移完毕，你根本没有机会靠可解释性或监管提前发现任何异常。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI安全</span><span class=\"tag\">对齐</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Four big ideas to tackle the climate crisis | Cooked? Ep 2 inclusive wealth cultivated meat antimicrobial resistance\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-16-naturepod-用更好吃的替代肉对抗气候变化-比劝人少吃肉更现实/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/91f00bc5f81d8d29-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"N\"><span class=\"dur\">46:40</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Nature Podcast</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1116</span></div>\n<h2>用更好吃的替代肉对抗气候变化，比劝人少吃肉更现实</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">人类试了五十年劝人少吃肉都没用，与其改变消费者，不如把肉重新造出来——植物肉和培育肉的真正推动力其实来自国家粮食安全，而不是气候。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">气候变化</span><span class=\"tag\">替代蛋白</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Credit Scores Mercantile Agency Fair Isaac / FICO Fair Credit Reporting Act D&amp;B credit rating\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-16-stuffmissed-现代征信巨头的起点是雇人打听邻居八卦来定你的信用/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/88586eb98e196b1a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">34:53</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Stuff You Missed in History Class</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1116</span></div>\n<h2>现代征信巨头的起点是雇人打听邻居八卦来定你的信用</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">今天的 Experian、Equifax、TransUnion 前身都是靠打听邻居隐私攒报告赚钱的公司，种族和宗教偏见从行业诞生第一天起就写进了信用记录。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">信用评分</span><span class=\"tag\">征信行业</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Software engineering after code becomes cheap with Satya Nadella decision engine software factory insider risk forward deployed engineer (FDE)\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-16-pragmatic-不自建ai基础设施的公司-纳德拉说这是自杀式战略/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/379b552d979e3271-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:02:40</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">The Pragmatic Engineer</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1116</span></div>\n<h2>不自建AI基础设施的公司，纳德拉说这是自杀式战略</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">纳德拉认为代码生成变便宜后，真正稀缺的是验证能力；而任何依赖单一模型厂商、不掌握自己上下文层和评估体系的公司，早晚会被模型厂商锁死。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI编码</span><span class=\"tag\">企业架构</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Philip Mannheim: Quantum Gravity &amp; Origin of Mass Explained FROM SCRATCH Tully-Fisher relation WIMP conformal gravity Ricci flat radial acceleration relation (RAR) Mach&#x27;s principle\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-16-theoriesofever-暗物质拟合138个星系要276个自由参数-这位物理学家只用4个/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c3d776280e2fd114-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">3:00:44</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Theories of Everything with Curt Jaimungal</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1116</span></div>\n<h2>暗物质拟合138个星系要276个自由参数，这位物理学家只用4个</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">暗物质理论给每个星系配两个自由光晕参数，而且必须先测出自转曲线才能反推出这两个数；Mannheim 认为星系自转数据里天然存在的普适规律，才是牛顿黄金标准真正要求的东西。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">暗物质</span><span class=\"tag\">广义相对论</span>\n</div></div></a>"]